==Before operation==
{{Story head|The [[Doctor]] awakens in an unknown space, accompanied by [[Priestess]].}}
{{sc|RI Abyss Passage|mode=backgroundimg}}
{{sc|You might not remember exactly what today means to you.<br/>It would lead you into great danger if you do so.<br/>...<br/>No.<br/>You must remember.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|fades out|mode=background}}
{{sc|Distant Voice|...Condition... Stable...<br/>...Sorry...<br/>For making you suffer again.}}
{{sc|Priestess Memory|mode=image}}
{{sc|???|...<br/>Hold my hand tight, [[Doctor]].<br/>Next time, please don't leave me without saying a word.<br/>You wouldn't accept something like this happening again either, right?<br/>Mmm... What's wrong, Dr. {nickname}?<br/>Why are you looking at me so strangely?}}
{{sc|1|mode=background}}
{{sc|Doctor|(Unknown language) Pries... tess...?}}
{{sc|Priestess|*sigh* Where did you manage to learn such a strange language this time around?<br/>Did you sneakily upload your cognition to some civilization out on the tip of the spiral arm in this round of hibernation?<br/>Alright, I'd just like to reconfirm whether or not your capability for language has been properly restored.<br/>Don't tell me that you've even forgotten my name just because you've had a big nap.<br/>Come on, say my name again. The database will analyze all of your voice data.}}
{{sc|Doctor|Pries...tess...}}
{{sc|Priestess|You recovered rather quickly, {nickname}.<br/>But since your body has only just revived, it still hasn't fully acclimated yet.<br/>So don't make any sudden movements. NX-07 will press you back into bed if you do. Its new orders are rather difficult to rescind, so I'm afraid that my hands are tied.}}
{{sc|Doctor|You... Where am I?}}
{{sc|Priestess|You're still on "[[Rhodes Island]]", of course. Our home.}}
{{sc|Doctor|You mean... just me? / What about the others... on Rhodes Island...}}
{{sc|mode=branch}}
{{sc|Doctor|You mean... just me?}}
{{sc|Priestess|Just you? Hey, I'm here too.}}
{{sc|mode=branch}}
{{sc|Doctor|What about the others... on Rhodes Island...}}
{{sc|Priestess|...You really do keep asking this every time.}}
{{sc|mode=branchend}}
{{sc|Priestess|It all happened so fast. The damage to the defense array exceeded ninety percent, and with all the extreme environmental damage we received, the repair units were finding it difficult to restore everything in the short time that we had.<br/>Not long after you began your hibernation, many of our colleagues left, one after the other. Everyone wanted to treasure the time they had before the stars fell. I understand how they felt.<br/>Now it's just the two of us left. Of course, [[Kal'tsit|AMa-10]] is still here as well. She's in good spirits, and still rather lively.<br/>But don't worry, what's left of Rhodes Island can still maintain its basic functions. We still have some time.<br/>When you are here with me, {nickname}, I'm not afraid of the end.<br/>No matter if our bodies collapse, or if our consciousnesses freeze, or if the laws of the universe invert, I can accept it all with open arms.<br/>I need only have you by my side.}}
{{sc|Doctor|...}}
{{sc|Priestess|You seem rather absent-minded today. Still not fully awake from your dream, {nickname}?}}
{{sc|She takes your hand, pressing it against her cheek.<br/>The touch of her skin is warm. Its corporeality snaps you out of your dream.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|Priestess|If that's the case, then I would like to know what you dreamed of.<br/>Although I will say that I would prefer if I were in it.}}
{{sc|Doctor|... / Dream...? / A very long dream...?}}
{{sc|mode=flashbackstart}}
{{sc|Catastrophe Imminent|mode=image}}
{{sc|"[[Terra]]".<br/>That land... [[Catastrophe]]... [[Oripathy]]...<br/>You wandered that land for several years. Felt how real everything was. All too real.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|Rosmontis Celebrated|mode=image}}
{{sc|The jubilant cries of the masses still echo in your ears.<br/>The Catastrophes have not yet stifled all hope. Beneath the trauma and the suffering, you can still feel a warmth, enduring, eternal.<br/>It is warm. It is touching. You are surrounded by a gentle crowd of people.<br/>'Rhodes Island'.<br/>You will never forget Rhodes Island.<br/>Rhodes Island healed your scars. Rhodes Island allowed you to have your regrets.<br/>You are still standing with it, aren't you?|mode=speech}}
{{sc|fades out|mode=background}}
{{sc|You have been to lands covered in ice and snow with them.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|Mount Karlan Foothills|mode=backgroundimg}}
{{sc|fades out|mode=background}}
{{sc|Felt the soft sand at the shore with them.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|Siesta Beach|mode=backgroundimg}}
{{sc|fades out|mode=background}}
{{sc|Witnessed how they live.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|46_i01|mode=image}}
{{sc|fades out|mode=background}}
{{sc|Witnessed how they die.|mode=speech}}
