{{sc|Kawalerielki Arena Tribune Night|mode=backgroundimg}}
{{sc|fades out|mode=background}}
{{sc|You accompanied those idealists against the surging heat, no matter if it would sear your flesh.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|Chernobog Control Tower Burning|mode=backgroundimg}}
{{sc|fades out|mode=background}}
{{sc|You saw vile empires, and the sorrow of those unable to fight their fate.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|Londinium Avenue|mode=backgroundimg}}
{{sc|fades out|mode=background}}
